<title>CANADA: Western Canada fertilizer shipment, inventory - CFI.</title>
<headline>Western Canada fertilizer shipment, inventory - CFI.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Fertilizer Institute released its shipment and inventory data on Monday.</p>
<p>Western Canadian Fertilizer Shipments</p>
<p>	  July to August 1995 vs 1996</p>
<p>Fertilizer	  Prev Yr (94/95)  Cur Yr (95/96)  Pct Change</p>
<p>UREA		    103,107 tonnes   195,502 tonnes+89.6 pct</p>
<p>AMMONIUM SULPHATE     3,680		9,935	+170.0</p>
<p>AMMONIUM NITRATE     26,421	     39,949	 +51.2</p>
<p>ANHYDROUS AMMONIA     5,154	     11,661	+126.3</p>
<p>OTHER*		    4,663		4,403	  -5.6</p>
<p>TOTAL		   143,025	    261,450	 +82.8</p>
<p>Inventories on August 31, 1995 vs 1996</p>
<p>Fertilizer	  Aug 31, 1995     Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>UREA		    275,299 tonnes   160,390 tonnes</p>
<p>AMMONIUM SULPHATE   110,503	    111,580</p>
<p>AMMONIUM NITRATE     55,511	     38,169</p>
<p>ANHYDROUS AMMONIA   227,543	    158,399</p>
<p>OTHER*		   12,533		8,255</p>
<p>TOTAL		   681,389	    476,793</p>
<p>*other includes other phosphates, sulphur solutions, elemental sulphur, sulphate and mixed fertilizer materials.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
